#====================================================================
# DRAFT-arb-2.9.0-flint3-merge-compat.kv — FLINT 3.x 并入 arb 的兼容适配
#====================================================================
id:                     DRAFT-arb-2.9.0-flint3-merge-compat
trigger_tool:           clang|ld|make|configure
phase:                  compilation|linking|runtime
error_signature:        redefinition of 'fmpz_add_si'|
                         static declaration of 'fmpz_ui_pow_ui' follows non-static|
                         unknown type name 'mp_bitcnt_t'|
                         use of undeclared identifier 'EXIT_SUCCESS'|
                         Error relocating.*mpn_neg_n|
                         Error relocating.*n_gcd_full|
                         -r and -pie may not be used together|
                         too few arguments.*_fmpz_poly_div|
                         call to undeclared function 'flint_mpn_copyi'

severity:               2
category:               compat, linking, headers, build-system
match_keywords:         FLINT, arb, fmpz_extras, flint_ctz, flint_clz,
                         count_trailing_zeros, count_leading_zeros, mpn_neg_n,
                         n_gcd_full, __FLINT_VERSION, -no-pie, fmpz_kronecker,
                         FLINT 3, fmpq_vec, fmpz_vec, ulong_extras
title:                  FLINT >= 3 已并入 arb 模块,FLINT-2.x 时代独立库需版本守卫与符号别名

# ═══ 诊断层 ═══
root_cause:             FLINT 3.x 将 arb 合并进 flint/fmpz.h 等公共头,
                         旧版 arb(如 2.9.0)自带 fmpz_extras.h 静态副本与之重复定义;
                         FLINT 3 flint.h 只含 stddef.h 不再传递包含 gmp.h/longlong.h/
                         fmpz_vec.h/fmpq_vec.h/ulong_extras.h;GMP >= 6.2 改名
                         mpn_neg_n->mpn_neg,FLINT 3 移除 n_gcd_full;
                         OHOS clang 默认 -pie 与 autotools 模块部分链接 -Wl,-r 冲突
affected_scope:         基于 FLINT 2.x API 的独立库(arb <= 2.23 及同类)适配
                         FLINT 3.x / OHOS 工具链;上游测试头链修复
verification_cmd:       conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 &&
                         conan test 上游测试台账 662/667 通过

# ═══ 方案层 ═══
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           flint3-merge-arb-compat
rec_description:        用 __FLINT_VERSION >= 3 守卫跳过 arb 自带重复定义,
                         提供 count_trailing_zeros/count_leading_zeros 别名到
                         flint_ctz/flint_clz,补 mpn_neg_n/n_gcd_full 兼容层,
                         显式包含 gmp.h/stdlib.h/longlong.h/fmpz_vec.h/fmpq_vec.h/
                         mpn_extras.h/ulong_extras.h,部分链接加 -no-pie,
                         _fmpz_poly_div 传 exact 参数
rec_command:            (见 archive 补丁 0001-0006;FMPZ_EXTRAS 守卫模式:
                         #if __FLINT_VERSION >= 3 ... #endif)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch

principles:
associated_entries:     E014(仅表面符号缺失相似,已排除)

last_updated:           2026-09-18
source_pr:              (本任务 PR 创建后回填)
author:                 pc4-27 (oh-executor)
